Hi folks,

RFC 3986 _obsoletes_ RFC 2396.

Warning - numerous ABNF productions from RFC 2396 (and
earlier versions) have been DELETED - new ABNF elements
with DIFFERENT names have been added - any URI scheme 
definition in a standards spec will need revising.

Claudia - please forward this to CIP4 - all standards
specs will need revision for this new reference.

Cheers,
